  unitName: Holy Svafa (EU)
  unitId: 720114
  unitNumber: 7024
  description: "Part of the pantheon of fierce warriors coming from the coldest territories
    of Grand Gaia. Their legend tells us that 6 exceptional semi-goddesses select
    among the best of dying combatants, whom would be granted the right to enter
    their heaven and fight side by side with the gods. Svafa, once known for her
    kindness, has been challenged by one of her own. She has taken it upon herself
    to reach inland to cover for one of her colleagues\u2019 flight from her responsibilities.
    Those who know her well say she lost some of her reserve from overwork."
  summonDesc: Valhalla! Nice to meet you.
  fusionDesc: What a great feeling. I like that.
  evoDesc: With more power comes more responsibility.
  element: 2
  rarity: 4
